\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Backwash Receiver\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Background script for the SEND TO TRACK button of the Backwash JSFX plugin. It saves the rendered result as a WAV file in the project folder and places it on the selected track. Run it once; it can also start with REAPER.\par}
}
